OL,3,GNEWSASecond man admits manslaughter of
OL,4,Achildren's nurse Karen Cummings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man has pleaded guilty to the
OL,7,Fmanslaughter of children's nurse Karen
OL,8,FCummings.
OL,10,FGlenn Robert King, 34, whose address
OL,11,Fwas given as HMP Magilligan, admitted
OL,12,Fthe charge on Thursday.
OL,14,FKaren Cummings, 40, who worked in Daisy
OL,15,FHill Hospital in Newry, was found
OL,16,Funconscious with a serious head injury
OL,17,Fin Laurel Heights in Banbridge, in
OL,18,FCounty Down, in December 2024.
OL,20,FThe emergency services attended the
OL,21,Fscene but she was pronounced dead a
OL,22,Fshort time later.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
